  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ah, my little knave, you say? I knew the Sun shone upon her journey. As for yours...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_104.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It seems the Scholomance approves of your demonstration of power.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_105.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It is as I said, the Scholomari are not what it wants. It isn't interested in sycophants; it seeks to make its own out of the untarnished.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_106.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "My test of Wands wasn't even a test of power, but intention. The Lagoon showed me a reflection of the future, of an unruly apprentice.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_107.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I don't know if the Shadows of the Lagoon wanted her saved or if the Scholomance just wanted to know if I would do it. But I did. I took that child away.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_108.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then the last leg of my path was revealed. Take your reward, Magician, reveal yours.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_109.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Incredible! A true academy of Shadow Magic, the neglected force of nature, the chaotic froth from which order is congealed. Here, they used to teach it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_111.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Or so I am told. It was before my time, but the cards hint at great knowledge buried under the weight of malevolence. This school was tainted by evil.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_112.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then it was torn down. But it is in here you will find the last thing you need. The Scholomance reverberates through Cups, Swords, Coins and Wands...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_113.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...But there is an ineffable Arcana which inspires all music. That I expect is what awaits you up there...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_114.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Claim the Score, Magician, and play your final song.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_115.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And so ended my path. I found what I sought, what I really sought: my humanity. I returned to the Outsiders with whom I left Velma.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_124.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I aided them as best I could. As for your path, the destruction of that Score is a problem.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_125.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Without it, you need another source of Arcana, another song to stir the Scholomance... another font of forbidden or ancient... knowledge...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_126.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ah, the Moon can reveal much if it is willing. Unless the Moon is but the Sun reversed, then it may hamper our quest.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_127.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Gray Man, Magician, I speak of him. The shrouded man at the head of the Parliament of Night, he knows more than any of us. But does he know enough?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_128.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I know not. You must find out, or wait until your quarry leaves the Scholomance with whatever power she seeks there.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_129.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-004_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will remain here. Return to camp and tell Glorina of your success and your need. She will aid you, I am sure.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Scholomari_FortuneF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Keziah_DM-BLACK_130.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700036,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-016_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ah, lost Scion, you return! With the Anti-Curse, I hope!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portraits_OutsiderQueen_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Queen_Glorina_DM-BLACK_035.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700048,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
